SUMMARY:BEKSCITY Run: Run and Rumble
LOCATION:Moore Junction\, Abeokuta\, Ogun State\, Nigeria
DESCRIPTION:BEKSCITY RUN CLUB — Run and Rumble\nCategory: Monthly Signature Event\nDistrict: ALL DISTRICTS\nMeeting Point: Moore Junction\nDistance: 7 km\nRoute Stops: 3 stops along the route\nPartners: Archers Live\; Game Experience\nEvent Lead: Organising Committee\n\nPLANNED ACTIVITIES:\n7 km run\, three stops along the route\, and post-run games.\n\nABOUT THIS RUN:\nRun and Rumble is a premier evening signature event. Runners take on an energetic 7 km route across the city with three dedicated hydration and regrouping stops. The run concludes with post-run competitive games\, social bonding\, music\, and community celebrations from 4:00 PM to 9:00 PM.\n\nSPECIAL EVENING SCHEDULE:\n• 04:00 PM — Gathering & pre-run excitement at Moore Junction\n• 04:30 PM — Run and Rumble 7 km run (3 stops)\n• 06:30 PM — Post-run games\, social bonding\, and celebrations\n• 09:00 PM — Event close\n\nBEKSCITY RUN CLUB | Keep Moving Forward
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:Monthly Signature Event
TRANSP:OPAQUE
SEQUENCE:0
